{comment: Verse 1}
[C]You were a lover before time's beginning
[F]You gave Your love freely with holding nothing, Je[F]sus, m[G]y Jesus
[C]You carried the weight of the world on Your shoulders
[F]You stopped at nothing to prove you were for us, [F]Jesus, my Je[G]sus

{comment: Chorus}
